WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:13.500
When you eat less, some of the weight you lose can be muscle. Enough protein and regular strength training help you keep it.

2
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Your Blueprint sets a daily protein target based on your body size and your clinician's guidance where relevant.

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Aim to include a palm-sized protein portion at each meal rather than saving it all for dinner.
